<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 392)</h2>
<p><b>The Reviewer Guide — a client manual for the people you invite.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Help → Asobi Manual gains a third book: the <b>Reviewer Guide</b>, six short chapters for invited reviewers — joining from an invite, watching, marking up, compare &amp; looks, and the Expert reviewer tools. Read it to see exactly what your guests read.</li>
<li>Share to Web… now follows the same rule as the export items: reviewer invites without media export don't see it.</li>
<li>Manual rendering: bullets that wrap across lines no longer split mid-sentence.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
